<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady/off $.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady/off $.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts steady to $.50 lower than Thursday's close. Top $53.00 per cwt.-USDA</p>
<p>Demand and Supply moderate.</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    51.50-53.00</p>
<p>US 1-2    210-220 lbs    48.50-51.50</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-230 lbs    50.50-51.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-270 lbs    50.50-51.50</p>
<p>	    270-280 lbs    49.50-50.50</p>
<p>Sows steady. Top 56.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    50.00-56.00</p>
</text>
